WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.503
♪ (INSPIRATIONAL MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.840
HASAN MINHAJ:
<i> While I'm watching this live,</i>

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.707
<i> I'm like,
 "This cannot be happening.</i>

00:00:08.807 --> 00:00:09.909
This cannot be happening."

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.811
JENNY YANG:<i> I think
 it just blew all of our minds</i>

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.514
<i> that we would see someone
 that looked like my cousin</i>

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:16.382
dominate on an NBA court.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.451
SPEAKER:
<i> It's the most impossible thing</i>

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:20.720
<i> I think I have ever witnessed
 in my life.</i>

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:22.255
(CROWD CHEERS)

00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:27.159
When most Americans
think about Asians,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:30.396
they think about dry cleaners,
they think about IT guys.

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:33.199
Small, passive,
diminutive, unathletic.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:37.203
The stereotyping, the derision
are so rampant.

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.539
You don't think no Asian kid
that's this size

00:00:40.639 --> 00:00:41.708
is gonna be dunking.

00:00:43.042 --> 00:00:45.044
JEREMY LIN:<i> This is who I am,
 this is what I'm capable of.</i>

00:00:45.144 --> 00:00:46.979
All you guys need to do
is watch and see.

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:48.814
SPEAKER 2:
<i> This kid came out of nowhere,</i>

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.583
<i>started balling, like, for real.</i>

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:53.118
LISA LING:<i> It wasn't just
 Asian people talking about it.</i>

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.453
Everybody was talking about it!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.256
TYSON CHANDLER:<i> The Lakers
 came in with the idea that</i>

00:00:57.356 --> 00:00:59.158
we're gonna end this fairytale,
we're gonna end it tonight.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.594
YANG:<i> But Jeremy
 just kept making shots.</i>

00:01:01.694 --> 00:01:04.764
He gave all y'all
what y'all wanted to see.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:07.033
MINHAJ:<i> Is this
 the other plot of</i> Space Jam?

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.502
Like, whose superpowers
did Jeremy Lin steal?

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.938
SPEAKER 3:<i> Yo,
 this dude scored 38 points!</i>

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.906
SPEAKER 4:
<i> At The Garden, at the Metro.</i>

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:17.010
The biggest thing
Linsanity brought was hope.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.711
<i> It inspired people.</i>

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:20.780
LING:<i> The last few years,</i>

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.583
<i> Asian Americans have just
 gotten beaten down.</i>

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:27.019
<i> And when I think back
 on Linsanity,</i>

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:32.659
<i> I long to feel those moments
 of just pure joy and unity.</i>

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.462
MINHAJ:<i> This moment,
 it broke the matrix for us.</i>

